{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-03",
  "title": "Warning Shot",
  "storyCode": "10-4",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7218900b6077c9eda499d1c7bf0307fa8145b7b2f2818c22e6ee0d47024027c1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "text": "Gah! The lift fell over––",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "text": "If it had been a little lower, m-my leg would've...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "Hold on.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "I mean, hold on to my construct!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "You idiot... Don't drag me down too! It's hard enough to stay afloat bringing you bunch with me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "text": "C-Captain... Thank you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "Next time, be smarter about how you run so you're less of a nuisance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "text": "Watch out, Captain!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "That's... an artillery shell?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "No, it's far more destructive than normal artillery...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "And, it was aimed so precisely at a small area?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "Manfred... You've been watching us this whole time?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "Bloody hell, that slimy devil!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "Alright, everyone stop right here! We don't need to chase after those Sarkaz. As for the driver...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "He's dead.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "This accursed place...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen?",
      "text": "Lieutenant, wh-what is this...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "............",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen?",
      "text": "How can the city's defense artillery do this...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "Londinium's wall defenses were built almost seventy years ago.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "This is the first time...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "Their cannons have been aimed... inside the city.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Not too shabby.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Even 10% of its firepower is enough to melt ordinary structures.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "So this is Londinium's ultimate defense.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "That was only an auxiliary cannon.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Our weapon experts have said the main guns are able to easily penetrate the armor of any high-speed warship.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "A weapon expert...? Are you talking about the officer from the defense forces' engineering team?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "I must thank you for capturing his wife and daughter.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Is he still alive?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "As long as he is of use to the Sarkaz, he will not die.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Artilleryman, target Lift 11.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "The shot went wide.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Unfortunate. We'll have to improve our accuracy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "These cannons were meant to point outwards, after all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Outwards... Before we entered Londinium, the defensive artillery was aimed at the ducal army outside the walls.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "When we entered the city under the guise of quelling the dukes' conflicts, they never even once thought to put us in their sights––",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Does that count as pointing outward?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "Since the fall of Gaul and the silence of Iberia, a long time has passed without Victoria facing any real external threat.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Indeed, which is why His Majesty found this opportunity for us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Such sophisticated weaponry should be put to greater use, rather than sitting here as ornaments adorning the doorway.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Artilleryman, activate dynamic target tracking.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Very good, it's working.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "We had to spend nearly a whole month to calibrate them...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Luckily, they seem to be working well enough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "These weapons put us in control of everything that enters and exits Londinium.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Once all our cannons are in place... There will be nowhere to hide under the shadow of these steel walls.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "Dublinn seems to be drawing away the artillery fire.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "Is this... a test run? Is their purpose really just to calibrate...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "No, they're ultimately unconcerned with this port.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen?",
      "text": "Lieutenant, what do we do now?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "Continue to withdraw towards the city.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "However... the rest of Sudean is no longer safe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "The Sarkaz are tightening their grip on Londinium. As long as the city's artillery is pointed inwards, our lives are in their hands.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "Unless...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen?",
      "text": "What's your plan, Lieutenant?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "It's nothing. Let's go, we'll talk after we've made our escape.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "These bloody walls! These bloody cannons!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "text": "Captain, your constructs got destroyed again...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "I don't... have time for this!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "Don't just stand there staring! Away with you! Get out of here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "Forcing us to run, eh? Mark my words, Manfred, you insult me like this today, I swear I'll...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "text": "Captain, that one I just saw running off that way... looked rather familiar...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "The Lupo brunette? Is it her?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Get her——\nUgh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "text": "Be careful, Captain!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "What have you done?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "text": "I'm... protecting you... run! You still have to... find... for the Leader...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "Fine... fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "You're the thirteenth.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "text": "The thirteenth Taran life. I will mark you down in the Leader's place. One day, I will personally make the Sarkaz pay for each and every life.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "text": "General, we've routed Dublinn's team.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "I saw.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "text": "But we couldn't find the rebels... Those sly insects! They peeked their heads out for a moment, but they vanished again after we activated the cannons.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "text": "Uhh, could they have been killed already?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "What do you think?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "text": "I... I don't think our job would be that easy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "I'm glad you understand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "text": "Then, did they blend into the crowd? Should we notify the patrol so they can detain the civilians and continue the search?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "No need.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Continue to bombard the port. Oh, and increase the firepower.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "text": "Increase the firepower? The port is almost completely destroyed. I can't imagine anyone would be hiding there still.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "They won't ever take this route again. Besides, have you ever seen a Sarkaz draw only half his sword?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Now that we've begun, why not let them see exactly what we're capable of?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "text": "You're putting on a show of force for them. You want... to cut off their escape and force them to come out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "This game of hide-and-seek has gone on long enough. Even if I don't mind waiting, the same cannot be said for His Majesty and the Royal Court.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "text": "Doesn't matter who it is. If they have a plan, I'd like them to hurry up with it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Doctor, we don't have anywhere safe to hide!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Even if we all took cover under the structure, we'd still be...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "...Vulnerable to their artillery blowing us to bits!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "I've done some rough calculations. If those cannons are fully charged, they'd be able to shoot clean through a standard city plate! This flimsy sheet plate above our heads on the wall there won't stand a chance!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Siege, Londinium's cannons here are serious business!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "This is the first time I've seen them fired off on such a scale.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "That means they're rolling out the red carpet for us, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "If that were the idea, we would be wiped out fifty kilometers outside the walls.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Urgh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Ahhh, I can't take it anymore––!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Amiya, my drones can't reinforce these plates any further. At this rate, we're going to get blasted sky-high!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We need to get out of here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Dublinn also scrambled to get away as fast as they could... but they used Arts constructs to defend themselves and left their wounded behind.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen",
      "text": "Ugh... Argh, why's our luck so rotten...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen",
      "text": "Are we going to die here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "We won't leave a single Londinier behind.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Scout team, have you located the artillerymen?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Not yet...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "I'm afraid we can't find them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Londinium's urban defense cannons, and this wall looming in front of us, have always been a single entity.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "In other words... we have no way of stopping the barrage if we can't scale the wall or get inside it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Nobody can scale a wall under fire.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "We couldn't find a way inside.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "We can't just hide here waiting to die either!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "Why don't I run out there and try to draw their fire? With my skills, I should be able to buy a few minutes...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Not happening.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dagda",
          "text": "If you're not letting her do it alone, then let's all go.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "text": "Settle down, you two. Dagda, have you been hanging around Indra for so long that your brain turned to muscle?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dagda",
          "text": "Hey...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "text": "If it was as easy as getting some live bait out there, would the two of you still be here making a scene?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "text": "Our armor could maybe take two hits from a standard crossbow. Our friends in Engineering spent months working hard to make it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "text": "If you're going to run out there and get yourself killed, you never should've come to Londinium in the first place!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "Alright, I get it. But I swear, I'm not letting anything happen to Vina!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "We... haven't even been home yet!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "True, there's no point in running out there.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "It's too early to be saying that kind of stuff.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Doctor, do you have a plan?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "The drones.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "Drones...? Hmm, hmm, I see... Oh, so that's where you're going with it. That makes sense.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "What are you mumbling about now, Closure? The Doctor barely said two words, but you're acting like you had a whole conversation!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "Oh, my bad. I just got an idea.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "Those cannons seem pretty intelligent, and at such a long range, they can't be completely manual. They must have some way of locking onto moving targets near the ground.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "One or two guys running around won't be enough to get the cannons off our backs.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "If I deploy all my drones at once, the targeting algorithm might see them as a higher-priority threat than us and the civilians, but...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "But there's no guarantee?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "Well obviously, I can't promise anything!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
          "text": "Closure, the reinforcement failed. The pressure is too great for the drones to withstand!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
          "text": "The base plate is going to collapse within thirty seconds...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We have no other choice. Let's give it a try.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "On the Doctor's signal, all operators prepare to withdraw.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "Five, four, three––",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "Two––",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Run!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "Drones, launching!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Run, everyone! Go, go!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Did it work?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "It bought us just enough time to move to a structure a few steps away... but this place won't last long either.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "That was our one shot, too... My precious drones have all been reduced to scrap, and even I can't just conjure up another batch.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We can't safely move forward or retreat backwards. If we want to escape the cannon fire, we're going to have to take some risks.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I wish there were some way around all of this...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "I heard you needed a guide?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Huh?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Who's there?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Miss Cautus, I'd like to talk to you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "But before that, I'd appreciate it if you could have your people lower their weapons.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "You–– Who are you?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Let's save the introductions for later.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Claws, a machete, and this... Uhh, this hammer? Ma'am, your weapon looks plenty brilliant, but I'd appreciate it if you could keep it away from my head.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Otherwise, this friend of yours might be in danger.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "––Doctor!!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Huh? What happened?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Is he talking about me?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Not too close now.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "One more step, and your friend's head becomes a mess on the wall.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "A-Amiya, the drone...!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "One of the drones wrapped around when we weren't paying attention, and it's locked onto the Doctor's head!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "You sure know your stuff, Miss Pointy-Ears.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "To be honest, I'm getting more and more curious about you lot.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "All hands, weapons down.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "There we go, that's nice. Oh, make sure you get the message to your snipers around the corner too. I bet they haven't blinked once since I showed up.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Do as he says.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Lovely.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "––Sir.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I hope you believe us when we say that we'd never move to harm a stranger unprovoked, but––",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Harm one thread on the Doctor's hood and I promise you, right here, right now, I don't need a weapon to ensure you never threaten another human being.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Ahem...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "text": "Ugh... This place is already dangerous enough. Are we seriously going to get blown up before we even start our mission?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Right, if we don't want the Sarkaz to turn us to dust, we don't have time to be pointing weapons at each others' heads.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Listen up, I have an idea. Please come with me, nice and easy.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "I'm gonna keep borrowing your friend here until we get where we're going––",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "That's not very nice.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "And if I refuse?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Sorry, but you don't get a say. Behave yourself and come along with me, my faceless friend.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
